# "If the creature deals damage to a creature this turn, the creature dealt damage can't be regenerated this turn" asks
# what the permanent was as it was dealt the damage (CR 120.3d-e, 701.19c). Bot2's Grim Monolith is a 2/2 artifact
# creature under March of the Machines when Bot1's Runesworded Triskelion deals it 1 damage, and has a regeneration
# shield from Death Ward. March is destroyed, so the Monolith is a noncreature artifact as Disenchant destroys it: it still
# can't be regenerated, and goes to the graveyard - not exiled, since it is no creature as it is put there (CR 700.4).
